                    </label>

                    <label class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-white p-1 rounded border border-blue-100 shadow-2xs cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="custom-checkbox mt-0.5">
                        <span class="text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-tight">Existe APP, manguezal ou corpo hídrico próximo?</span>
                    </label>

                    <label class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-white p-1 rounded border border-blue-100 shadow-2xs cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="custom-checkbox mt-0.5">
                        <span class="text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-tight">O projeto interfere na drenagem natural do terreno?</span>
                    </label>

                    <label class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-white p-1 rounded border border-blue-100 shadow-2xs cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="custom-checkbox mt-0.5">
                        <span class="text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-tight">O projeto prevê ETE ou tratamento próprio de efluentes?</span>
                    </label>

                    <label class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-white p-1 rounded border border-blue-100 shadow-2xs cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="custom-checkbox mt-0.5">
                        <span class="text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-tight">O projeto prevê central de resíduos de saúde?</span>
                    </label>

                    <label class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-white p-1 rounded border border-blue-100 shadow-2xs cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="custom-checkbox mt-0.5">
                        <span class="text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-tight">A solução pode ser atendida por reforma ou readequação interna?</span>
                    </label>

                    <label class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-white p-1 rounded border border-blue-100 shadow-2xs cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition-colors">
                        <input type="checkbox" class="custom-checkbox mt-0.5">
                        <span class="text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-tight">É possível utilizar a área já edificada em vez de expandir a ocupação do terreno?</span>
                    </label>

                </div>
            </section>

        </main>

